  PaperPartBExactNoEmptyProfileContributionFixedMTerminalZeroTailEraseDistanceLayerCardUpperEnvelopeSumTarget
    partBTerminalZeroTailExactLayerCard
    (partBTerminalZeroTailExpDistanceEnvelope partBTerminalZeroTailExactLayerLogMax) ε δ

